  :question/id #uuid "df77f345-f20c-5f14-b98c-110b1ed20f2a"
  :question/problem "**(a)** For $\\mathbf F=\\langle x,-y\\rangle$, find a potential function $\\phi$ and a stream function $\\psi$. Draw a couple of equipotential curves and streamlines.\n\n![Source vector-field diagram](/api/asset?path=%2Fhome%2Fjake%2FDeveloper%2Fstudy%2Fvault%2FF26%2Fsource%2F255%2FR-5%2Ffield-1a.png)"
  :question/answer-fields ["bd86abe8-9fe0-5f81-b70e-916d5ea051fa"]
  :question/worked-solution "Check $\\nabla\\phi=(x,-y)$, $\\psi_y=x$, and $-\\psi_x=-y$. The potential curves are hyperbolas opening along the coordinate axes, while the streamlines are rectangular hyperbolas with the coordinate axes as their zero-level components."
  :db/ensure :question/validate}
